{"id":"52c2a3857da7da70","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-powers-congruence.md","title":"Powers Congruence","display":"Powers Congruence","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-powers-congruence","aliases":["93-fact-powers-congruence"],"display":"Powers Congruence","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-powers-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-powers-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Powers Congruence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}\\)</span>; the empty exponent is allowed.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta^I\">\\(\\theta^I\\)</span> is the coordinatewise relation defined below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^I)^2:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle f(i),g(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^I)^2:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle f(i),g(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\in\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\in\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The coordinatewise lift records its source algebra as well as its exponent. It is a congruence on the corresponding power because all fundamental operations are evaluated coordinatewise.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(|\\mathfrak A|^I)^2:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle f(i),g(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}powers\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\theta^I_{\\mathfrak A}\\in\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))","display":true}],"bytes":1195,"backlinks":[{"id":"5db3fa00f537080b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ is an arbitrary set and $\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}$ is the coordinatewise lift of [[93-fact-powers-congruence]]."}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","10bfe2126b30365e","30b341bfbd8b5301","9beeac4373d773f8"]}